# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
#
# core.autocrlf is true on Windows, and Git's content sniffing had already
# decided the documentation PDF was text — which would have rewritten LF to
# CRLF on the next checkout and handed anyone cloning the repository a corrupt
# file. Marking the types explicitly removes the guesswork.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
